@{ Layout = "_AccountLayout"; ViewData["Title"] = "Terms & privacy"; }
<article class="content-page legal-copy">
    <h1>Terms of Use &amp; Privacy</h1>
    <h2>Your account</h2><p>Use your own information when creating an account. Keep your password private and do not access accounts belonging to other people. Admin access requires an invitation from the system owner.</p>
    <h2>Information stored</h2><p>This application stores your name, email, a password hash, account creation and terms acceptance times, last login time, and failed login information. These records are used to authenticate your account and control access. User and admin records are stored separately.</p>
    <h2>Session cookies</h2><p>We use a session cookie to keep you logged in and security cookies to protect forms. Selecting “Remember me” keeps the login cookie after you close your browser. Log out on shared devices.</p>
    <h2>Account changes</h2><p>Contact the person or organization operating this installation to request an account correction or deletion. This installation does not yet provide an account deletion or password reset screen.</p>
    <a asp-action="Register">Back to create account</a>
</article>
